We test the timeout handling logic to verify:
\begin{itemize}
\item Cancel messages are generated with correct parameters
\item Requests are properly removed from the queue
\item Alternative peers are found when available
\item No alternative is returned when none qualify
\item The original peer is excluded from consideration
\end{itemize}

