<<event loop>>=
/// Default maximum number of pipelined block requests per peer.
///
/// BitTorrent benefits from request pipelining to hide network latency.
/// 10 requests is a common default that provides good throughput without
/// overwhelming slow peers or wasting bandwidth on cancelled requests.
pub const DEFAULT_MAX_PIPELINE_LENGTH: usize = 10;
